<!DOCTYPE html>



<html lang="en">



<head>



  <meta charset="UTF-8">



  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">



  <title>MindSpace Chat</title>



  <style>



    *{



      margin:0;



      padding:0;



      box-sizing:border-box;



      font-family:Arial, sans-serif;



    }



    html{



      scroll-behavior:smooth;



    }



    body{



      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4c1d95,#312e81,#be185d);



      color:white;



    }



    .hero{



      height:100vh;



      display:flex;



      flex-direction:column;



      justify-content:center;



      align-items:center;



      text-align:center;



      padding:20px;



    }



    .hero h1{



      font-size:70px;



      margin-bottom:20px;



    }



    .hero p{



      font-size:24px;



      color:#e5e7eb;



      margin-bottom:35px;



      max-width:800px;



      line-height:40px;



    }



    .btn{



      background:#ec4899;



      color:white;



      padding:15px 35px;



      border:none;



      border-radius:50px;



      text-decoration:none;



      font-size:18px;



      transition:0.3s;



      box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(236,72,153,0.5);



    }



    .btn:hover{



      background:#db2777;



      transform:scale(1.05);



    }



    section{



      padding:90px 20px;



    }



    .container{



      max-width:1100px;



      margin:auto;



    }



    .card{



      background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);



      padding:40px;



      border-radius:30px;



      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);



      box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);



    }



    h2{



      font-size:45px;



      margin-bottom:25px;



      color:#f9a8d4;



      text-align:center;



    }



    .story-text{



      font-size:21px;



      line-height:38px;



      color:#e5e7eb;



      text-align:center;



    }



    .cards{



      display:grid;



      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));



      gap:25px;



      margin-top:50px;



    }



    .work-card{



      background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);



      padding:35px;



      border-radius:30px;



      text-align:center;



      transition:0.4s;



      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);



      box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);



    }



    .work-card:hover{



      transform:translateY(-10px) scale(1.02);



    }



    .icon{



      font-size:55px;



      margin-bottom:15px;



    }



    .work-card h3{



      margin:15px 0;



      font-size:30px;



    }



    .work-card p{



      font-size:18px;



      line-height:32px;



      color:#e5e7eb;



    }



    .contact{



      text-align:center;



    }



    .contact p{



      font-size:20px;



      color:#e5e7eb;



      margin-top:10px;



      line-height:35px;



    }



    .email-btn{



      display:inline-block;



      margin-top:30px;



      background:#3b82f6;



      color:white;



      padding:16px 38px;



      border-radius:50px;



      text-decoration:none;



      font-size:18px;



      transition:0.3s;



      box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(59,130,246,0.5);



    }



    .email-btn:hover{



      background:#2563eb;



      transform:scale(1.05);



    }



    footer{



      text-align:center;



      padding:35px;



      border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);



      color:#d1d5db;



      font-size:18px;



    }



  </style>



</head>



<body>



  <!-- HERO SECTION -->



  <div class="hero">



    <h1>MindSpace Chat 💜</h1>



    <p>



      Your Safe Space To Talk, Heal, And Feel Supported.



      A place where teenagers can openly share feelings,



      overcome stress and overthinking, and connect with



      supportive AI companions and caring listeners anytime.



    </p>



    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Contact Us</a>



  </div>



  <!-- OUR STORY -->



  <section>



    <div class="container card">



      <h2>Our Story</h2>



      <p class="story-text">



        I am Siddhi Jain, a Class 8 student of Indira National School, Pune.



        I created MindSpace Chat because many teenagers silently struggle with



        stress, loneliness, overthinking, pressure, and difficult emotions.



        MindSpace Chat is designed to become a safe digital space where students



        can feel heard, emotionally supported, and never alone during tough moments.



      </p>



    </div>



  </section>



  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->



  <section>



    <div class="container">



      <h2>How MindSpace Chat Works</h2>



      <div class="cards">



        <div class="work-card">



          <div class="icon">🤖</div>



          <h3>AI Support Chatbots</h3>



          <p>



            MindSpace Chat includes intelligent AI chatbots that are always



            available to listen, guide, and support teenagers through stress,



            overthinking, emotional struggles, and difficult decisions in a



            calm and comforting way.



          </p>



        </div>



        <div class="work-card">



          <div class="icon">💬</div>



          <h3>Real-Time Support</h3>



          <p>



            Users can connect with trusted counselors, therapists, and supportive



            listeners who help teenagers feel emotionally safe and understood



            whenever they need someone to talk to.



          </p>



        </div>



        <div class="work-card">



          <div class="icon">💜</div>



          <h3>A Safe Teen Community</h3>



          <p>



            MindSpace Chat creates a positive and judgement-free environment



            where teenagers can openly express themselves, build confidence,



            reduce loneliness, and support one another through meaningful conversations.



          </p>



        </div>



      </div>



    </div>



  </section>



  <!-- CONTACT -->



  <section id="contact">



    <div class="container card contact">



      <h2>Contact Us</h2>



      <p>



        We'd love to hear your ideas, feedback, and support for MindSpace Chat.



        Together, we can create a safer and more positive digital space for teenagers.



      </p>



      <a href="mailto:siddhijainy@gmail.com" class="email-btn">



        siddhijainy@gmail.com



      </a>



    </div>



  </section>



  <!-- FOOTER -->



  <footer>



    Made By Students, For Students 💜



  </footer>



</body>



</html>


